fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"rtp/rtph264depay.html#rtph264depay:wait-for-keyframe","fragment":"\n\twait-for-keyframe\n\nWait for the next keyframe after packet loss.\nNote: currently this only has an effect if outputting access units.\n\n\tFlags :\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\tRead\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t/\t\t\n\t\t\t\tWrite\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\tDefault value :\tfalse\n\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.20\n\t\t\n"});